    "created_at": "2017-06-23T19:42:09Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-06-23T19:42:09Z",
    "body": "It probably wants the border box; that's the usual \"stuff that's painted\" rectangle that things care about.  (Margin box has invisible area, and can be difficult to define in some situations due to margin collapsing; border box is always simple and easy.)",
