    "created_at": "2017-06-30T18:14:01Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-06-30T18:14:01Z",
    "body": "Oh right, duh, boxes don't have positions. You want *fragments* - they're the positioned stuff that results from layout. Either the first border box fragment, or all border box fragments.\r\n\r\n(The accidental reuse of the term \"box\" between the [box-tree concept](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-display/#box) and the \"content/padding/border/margin box\" concepts is unfortunate, but too widespread to realistically fix at this point.  Both boxes and fragments have border boxes, for example.)",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
